  "body": "## Environment\n- magpie 0.1.1306\n- Ubuntu 24.04\n- Launched  `~/.config/autostart/magpie.desktop` \n\n##  What happens\nWhen magpie is autostarted at login, it crashes ~11s after launch. Launching it manually later works fine.\n\n```\npanic: runtime error: invalid memory address or nil pointer dereference\n[signal SIGSEGV: segmentation violation code=0x1 addr=0x60 pc=0x185f52a]\ngoroutine 261 [running]:\ngithub.com/wailsapp/wails/v3/pkg/application.(*App).dispatchOnMainThread(...)\n        github.com/wailsapp/wails/v3@v3.0.0-beta.24/pkg/application/application.go:983 +0x2a\ngithub.com/wailsapp/wails/v3/pkg/application.InvokeSync(...)\n        github.com/wailsapp/wails/v3@v3.0.0-beta.24/pkg/application/mainthread.go:26 +0x94\ngithub.com/yetone/magpie/internal/gui.Run.func13(...)\n        github.com/yetone/magpie/internal/gui/app.go:459 +0xb4\ncreated by github.com/yetone/magpie/internal/gui.(*updater).run in goroutine 88\n        github.com/yetone/magpie/internal/gui/update.go:366 +0xbd7\n```\n",
