   "created_at": "2026-10-27T19:01:56Z",
   "updated_at": "2026-10-27T19:01:56Z",
   "body": "Autostart at login panics in InvokeSync because the updater's first check comes back before the app's main thread is up. The updater's tray callbacks and AutoRestart now wait on Wails' ApplicationStarted before dispatching onto the main thread.\n\nBranch: [fix/3108-panic-when-autostarted-at-login](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/tree/fix/3108-panic-when-autostarted-at-login), commit f34ad344f5c9615811589eb33c7cc52fb3d449af\n\nVerified:\n- TestOnMainWaitsForTheMainThread fails without the guard, passes with it\n- go test -race -tags nogui ./internal/gui/ ok\n- go build ./..., go vet -tags nogui ./...\n\nThis is a fork branch for review, not a claim on the issue.\n",
